# Normalize line endings in the repository.
#
# Without this, a Windows checkout can rewrite whole files to CRLF and every
# line shows as changed. That happened: a one-line port change in serve.py was
# buried inside 6,850 lines of phantom diff. Text is LF in the repository and
# in the working tree; the index is the single source of truth for line endings.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary — never touched.
*.png binary
*.db  binary
